{"path":"/ja/tip/13-09","title":"突然「人生で最も激しい頭痛」が起こり、1時間以内にピークに達する場合、直ちに救急外来で頭部CTを受けてください。 | HowToLiveBetter","description":"重要なのは、どれほど早く痛みがピークに達するかです。1時間以内に最大級の痛みに達する激しい頭痛の約 6% は、脳表面の血管の破裂です。40 歳以上、首の痛みや硬直、周囲の人があなたの失神を目撃した、活動中に発症した、瞬間的に爆発するような痛み、首が前に曲げられない、といった症状が一つでもあれば、直…","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-tools"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-sound-toggle","aria-label":"効果音をオフ","aria-pressed":"true","title":"効果音をオフ"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-theme-trigger","aria-label":"システム","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-sun life-theme-icon-light","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 20v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"日本語 言語を選ぶ","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["日本語"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/ja/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["ログイン"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/ja/book/13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"目次に戻る"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["緊急事態：まず何をすべきか"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"この章のヒント"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"人が倒れて呼吸をしていない場合は、すぐに胸を強く圧迫し、周囲の人に 120 を呼び、AEDを探すよう指示してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"高齢者や人が倒れたら、まずしゃがんで呼びかけ120へ。急いで起こさない。中国では見知らぬ人から立ち去るのも合法だが、立ち止まってもむやみに動かさない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"突然口角がゆがむ、片腕に力が入らない、言葉が不明瞭になったら、すぐに 120 へ電話してください。待ってはいけません。自分で運転して行ってはいけません。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"突然のめまい、複視、片目の暗転、あるいは指で自分の鼻先を指せない。これらも脳卒中として 120 を呼び、記録すべき症状です"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"片方の目が突然、カーテンを下ろしたかのように暗くなった場合、たとえ数分で自然に回復したとしても、その日のうちに脳卒中を疑って救急外来を受診してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"片方の目が腫れぼったく痛み、充血しており、光を見ると虹色の輪が見える。さらに頭痛や吐き気も伴い、その日のうちに眼科救急を受診した"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"胸が圧迫されるような痛み、圧迫感、締め付け感が 15 分以上続き、和らがない場合は、120 に電話してください。自分で我慢したり、自分で運転したりしないでください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"突然、引き裂かれるような激痛が胸から背中、腰へと移動する場合、120 に電話し、「痛みが移動している」とはっきり伝えてください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/ja/tip/13-09","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"突然「人生で最も激しい頭痛」が起こり、1時間以内にピークに達する場合、直ちに救急外来で頭部CTを受けてください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"高齢者が頭を打った後、2〜3週間から数ヶ月して歩行が不安定、鈍化、嗜睡、または片側に力が入らなくなった場合は、頭部CT検査を受けてください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"片方の足が突然腫れたり、張ったり、押すと痛みを感じたりする場合は、早急に受診してください。さらに突然の息切れや胸痛が伴う場合は、直ちに 120 に電話してください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"大量出血時はまず手で傷口を強く圧迫し、四肢で抑えきれない場合は止血帯を使用、同時に 120 を呼ぶ"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"犬や猫に噛まれたり、ひっかかれて皮膚が傷ついたりした場合は、まず石鹸水と流水を交互に 15 分間洗い流し、当日にワクチンを接種してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"火傷の後はすぐに冷たい流水で 20 分間流してください。歯磨き粉や醤油は塗らないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"突然、全身に発疹が出たり、息苦しさやめまいを感じたりした場合は、アナフィラキシー・ショックとして対処し、直ちに 120 を呼び、状況を明確に伝えてください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"けいれんして倒れた人がいたら、周囲を片付け、横向きに寝かせ、時計で時間を計る。口の中に何も入れないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"糖尿病患者が突然の震え、冷や汗、ろれつが回らない状態になったら、まず 15 グラムの糖分を摂取させ、15 分後に再測定してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"感電事故が発生した際は、まず電源を遮断し、次に乾いた棒などを使って電源から引き離してください。直接手で引っ張ってはいけません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"一酸化炭警報器が鳴った、あるいは部屋にいる全員が同時に頭痛や吐き気を感じたら、まずは外に出てから電話をしてください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"洗剤、農薬、医薬品の誤飲時は無理に吐かせず、容器を持って直ちに受診してください。目や皮膚に付着した場合は、大量の流水で少なくとも 15 分間洗浄してください"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"酸・アルカリ等の化学薬品が体に付着した場合は、直ちに汚染された衣類を脱ぎ、大量の流水で洗い流してください。目はまぶたを広げて洗浄し、十分な時間をかけてから移動してください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"高温下でめまい、吐き気、発汗停止、または意識混濁がある場合は、直ちに涼しい場所に移動し、衣服を脱がせて水を浴びせて体温を下げてください。意識が混濁している場合は水を飲ませず、 120 を呼んでください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"熱中症の人が意識がはっきりしている場合は、冷たい薄い塩水またはスポーツ飲料を、少量ずつ頻回に飲ませてください。一気に飲ませたり、アルコールや高糖度の飲料を飲ませたりしないでください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"火災時は地面に這いつくばり、ドアに触れて確認してから開ける。ドアが熱い場合は開けない。階段を使い、エレベーターは使わない。外に出たら、振り返らない。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"溺水者を見かけたら、まずは周囲に助けを求め 110/120 に電話し、棒を伸ばしたり浮遊物を投げたりする。自分は水に入らない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"窒息して声が出ない1歳以上の人には、背後から背部叩打5回と腹部突き上げ5回。倒れたら心肺蘇生"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"ゴビ砂漠、砂漠、無人地帯で道に迷った、または車が故障した場合は、その場または車のそばに留まり、まず現在地を報告し、次に日よけと保温を行い、水を節約し、むやみに動かないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"震え、ろれつが回らない、ふらつきは低体温症の兆候。濡れた服を脱がせ、包み込み、まずは体幹を温める。温かい甘い飲み物を与える（アルコールは避ける）"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"蛇に噛まれたら、座って動かない。指輪や時計を外し、早急に抗蛇毒血清のある病院へ搬送する。切らない、吸わない、強く縛らない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"地震の際はまず自分がどのような建物にいるかを確認：耐震設計された建物ならその場で待避、倒壊の恐れがある古い建物なら、出口が数歩先なら外へ出る"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"クマ、イノシシ、野犬の群れに遭遇したら、走らず、横を向いてゆっくり後退する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-32"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"野外で雷雨に遭遇したら、硬い屋根のある車や建物の中に避難し、尾根、孤立した木、水面、金属から離れる"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-33"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"高地へ行く際は、睡眠高度（その夜眠る高さ）に合わせてゆっくりと高度を上げ、症状が悪化したら無理をせず下山する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-34"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"マダニに噛まれたら、先の細いピンセットで皮膚に沿わせながら、ゆっくりと垂直に引き抜く。油を塗ったり火で炙ったりしてはいけない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-35"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"野外の水は必ず沸騰させてから飲むこと。1分間の沸騰で十分であり、標高が高いからといって長く煮る必要はない"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-36"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"人里離れた場所で知らない人に財物を要求されたら、お金を渡し、抵抗せず、特徴を覚え、逃げた後に通報する"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-37"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"喧嘩の場面に遭遇したら、離れて立ち去ること。仲裁に入ったり、野次馬になったり、地面に落ちている武器を拾ったりしてはいけない。通報する場合は、安全な距離まで退いてから 110 する必要がある。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-38"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"HIVに曝露した可能性があります。72時間以内に予防薬（PEP）を受け取ってください。早ければ早いほど良いです。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-39"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"人を救って怪我をし、金銭的負担を負った場合は、まず加害者と医療保険に請求し、その後に義勇行為の認定申請を行う"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-40"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"ナイフ、鉄筋、ガラスなどが体に刺さった場合、異物の周囲を圧迫して止血し、決して引き抜かないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-41"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"骨折が疑われる場合はその部位を動かさない。動かさずに固定し、20 分以内を目安に冷やしてください。自分で無理に整復しないでください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-42"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"性被害に遭った後は、まず安全な場所に移動して 110番に通報してください。診察・証拠採取の前は、入浴、洗濯、部屋の片付けはしないでください。72 時間以内に病院へ行ってください。"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-43"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"1歳未満の乳児が詰まって声が出せない時：背中を5回叩き、仰向けにして胸を5回圧迫、これを繰り返す。お腹は押さないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-44"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"1歳未満の乳児に反応がなく、正常な呼吸が見られない場合は、スピーカーフォンで120番（救急）に電話し、乳児心肺蘇生法を行う：30回の圧迫に対して2回の人工呼吸"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/13"},"children":["第13章"," ·"," ","緊急事態：まず何をすべきか"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"13-09"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["09"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["突然「人生で最も激しい頭痛」が起こり、1時間以内にピークに達する場合、直ちに救急外来で頭部CTを受けてください。"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["重要なのは、どれほど早く痛みがピークに達するかです。1時間以内に最大級の痛みに達する激しい頭痛の約 6% は、脳表面の血管の破裂です。40 歳以上、首の痛みや硬直、周囲の人があなたの失神を目撃した、活動中に発症した、瞬間的に爆発するような痛み、首が前に曲げられない、といった症状が一つでもあれば、直ちに救完外来で頭部CTを受けてください。検査を受けて何も異常がないケースが大半ですが、一度の見逃しが再出血を招き、死に直結します。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["救急外来の受診自体に大きな費用はかかりません。救急での頭部CT検査は数百元程度です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["カナダの 10 箇所の救急外来において、2131 例の「1時間以内に激痛に達した激しい頭痛」を対象とした前向きコホート研究が行われ、事前に設定された基準に基づき追跡調査が記録されました。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：突然「人生で最も激しい頭痛」が起こり、1時間以内にピークに達する場合、直ちに救急外来で頭部CTを受けてください。"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["救急外来の受診自体に大きな費用はかかりません。救急での頭部CT検査は数百元程度です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["カナダの 10 箇所の救急外来において、2131 例の「1時間以内に激痛に達した激しい頭痛」を対象とした前向きコホート研究が行われ、事前に設定された基準に基づき追跡調査が記録されました。そのうち 132 例（6.2%）はくも膜下出血（脳表面の血管の破裂）でした。オタワSAHルールには、40 歳以上、項部硬直または頸部痛、意識消失の目撃がある、という6つの項目があります。残りの3つは、活動中の発症、突然の爆発的な発症、および医師の診察時に頸部の前屈が制限されることです。いずれか1つに該当すれば検査が必要です。このルールは出血がある人をすべて抽出します。感度は 100%、95% CI 97.2%–100.0%（信頼区間）です。代償として、出血がない人のうち除外されるのはわずか 15.3% です（特異度 15.3%）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Perry JJ, Stiell IG, Sivilotti MLA, et al. (2013). Clinical decision rules to rule out subarachnoid hemorrhage for acute headache. JAMA, 310(12), 1248-1255. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2013.278018","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2013.278018"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2013.278018","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["見るべきは「どれほど痛いか」ではなく、「どれほど早く最大級の痛みに達するか」です。数秒から1分以内に爆発的に始まる頭痛こそが危険信号であり、徐々に悪化する片頭痛はそうではありません。嘔吐、項部硬直（首の硬直）、光過敏、一時的な失神を伴う場合は、より一層注意が必要です。特異性はわずか 15.3% であり、これは、この基準に従って検査を受けた人の大部分は異常なしであることを意味します。しかし、一度の見逃しが再出血を招き、死に直結するため、検査を受ける価値は十分にあります。鎮痛剤を飲んで痛みを抑え、そのまま寝てしまわないでください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/13-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"突然、引き裂かれるような激痛が胸から背中、腰へと移動する場合、120 に電話し、「痛みが移動している」とはっきり伝えてください。"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/13-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"高齢者が頭を打った後、2〜3週間から数ヶ月して歩行が不安定、鈍化、嗜睡、または片側に力が入らなくなった場合は、頭部CT検査を受けてください"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/13-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["片方の目が突然、カーテンを下ろしたかのように暗くなった場合、たとえ数分で自然に回復したとしても、そ